Panza F, Lozupone M, Sardone R, Battista P, Piccininni M, Dibello V, et al. Sensorial frailty: age-related hearing loss and the risk of cognitive impairment and dementia in later life Therapeutic Advances in Chronic Disease. 2018.
Abrams H. Hearing Loss and Associated Comorbidities: What Do We Know?. The Hearing Review. 2017.
Quesnel AM, Ishai R, McKenna MJ. Otosclerosis Temporal Bone Pathology. Otolaryngolgic Clinics of North America. 2018:291-303.
