¿Whats is Blockchain?
It is protected by cryptography and distributed among a multitude of machines that have a complete or partial copy of its content.
With a blockchain, many people can write entries into a record of information, and a community of users can control how the record of information is amended and updated.
Likewise, Wikipedia entries are not the product of a single publisher. No one person controls the information.
